<section id="consulting-engagements"><h2>5. Consulting Engagements</h2><p>Actual consulting engagements are governed by separate agreements, proposals, statements of work, or other mutually accepted terms. Project scope, pricing, timelines, deliverables, and responsibilities are determined separately for each engagement.</p></section>
<section id="accuracy-of-website-information"><h2>6. Accuracy of Website Information</h2><p>WILLDUET CORP. attempts to maintain accurate and useful website information. Content may change and should not be treated as a binding project proposal, commitment, or representation that a particular service is available on specific terms.</p></section>
<section id="intellectual-property"><h2>7. Intellectual Property</h2><p>WILLDUET branding, original website copy, graphics, articles, educational materials, and other original website content are owned by WILLDUET CORP. or used with appropriate permission. Unauthorized commercial copying or redistribution is not permitted.</p></section>
<section id="articles-and-educational-content"><h2>8. Articles and Educational Content</h2><p>Articles, guides, and other informational resources provide general information and are not customized professional advice for a particular organization or situation.</p></section>
<section id="third-party-websites-and-services"><h2>9. Third-Party Websites and Services</h2><p>The website may link to or use third-party websites and services. Their availability, content, and practices are controlled by their respective providers, not WILLDUET CORP.</p></section>
<section id="disclaimer"><h2>10. Disclaimer</h2><p>The website and its general informational content are provided on an “as available” basis. To the extent permitted by applicable law, WILLDUET CORP. does not make warranties about uninterrupted availability or that all content will be error-free or suitable for every purpose.</p></section>
<section id="limitation-of-liability"><h2>11. Limitation of Liability</h2><p>To the extent permitted by applicable law, WILLDUET CORP. will not be liable for indirect or consequential losses arising solely from use of, or inability to use, this website. Nothing in these Terms excludes or limits rights or liabilities that cannot legally be excluded or limited.</p></section>
<section id="changes-to-these-terms"><h2>12. Changes to These Terms</h2><p>WILLDUET CORP. may update these Terms when its website, services, or applicable requirements change. The date above identifies the latest update.</p></section>
